Q 'witch' 'Witch Watch' 'kill:minecraft:witch*4' 'slime' 'xp:75;table:common' -desc 'Watch for thrown potions. Loot and environmental kills may behave differently: land the killing blow yourself.'
Q 'pillager' 'Crossbow Patrol' 'kill:minecraft:pillager*8' 'start' 'xp:75;table:common' -desc 'Fight pillagers away from villagers. Loot and environmental kills may behave differently: land the killing blow yourself.'
Q 'vindicator' 'Mansion Contract' 'kill:minecraft:vindicator*4' 'pillager' 'xp:75;table:common' -desc 'Keep a safe escape route. Loot and environmental kills may behave differently: land the killing blow yourself.'
Q 'blaze' 'Blaze Contract' 'kill:minecraft:blaze*8' 'start' 'xp:75;table:common' -desc 'Visit a Nether Fortress with fire resistance. Loot and environmental kills may behave differently: land the killing blow yourself.'
