Q 'hoglin' 'Crimson Contract' 'kill:minecraft:hoglin*6' 'start' 'xp:75;table:common' -desc 'Keep clear of ledges in Crimson Forests. Loot and environmental kills may behave differently: land the killing blow yourself.'
Q 'enderman' 'Eyes in the Dark' 'kill:minecraft:enderman*12' 'start' 'xp:75;table:common' -desc 'Avoid unnecessary fights and keep an escape route. Loot and environmental kills may behave differently: land the killing blow yourself.'
Q 'shulker' 'End City Clearance' 'kill:minecraft:shulker*8' 'enderman' 'xp:75;table:common' -desc 'Bring a plan for levitation and falls. Loot and environmental kills may behave differently: land the killing blow yourself.'
Q 'phantom' 'Night Flyers' 'kill:minecraft:phantom*4' 'skeleton' 'xp:75;table:common' -desc 'Phantoms appear after extended time without sleeping; sleep afterwards. Loot and environmental kills may behave differently: land the killing blow yourself.'
Q 'guardian' 'Ocean Monument Patrol' 'kill:minecraft:guardian*8' 'drowned' 'xp:75;table:common' -desc 'Prepare water breathing and underwater equipment. Loot and environmental kills may behave differently: land the killing blow yourself.'
Q 'wither' 'Boss Contract: Wither' 'kill:minecraft:wither' 'wither_skeleton' 'xp:300;table:rare' -desc 'Fight the Wither in a controlled arena away from your base. Loot and environmental kills may behave differently: land the killing blow yourself.'
Q 'dragon' 'Boss Contract: Ender Dragon' 'kill:minecraft:ender_dragon' 'enderman' 'xp:300;table:rare' -desc 'Bring blocks, food, a bow and a plan for the crystals. Loot and environmental kills may behave differently: land the killing blow yourself.'

Chapter 'neovitae' 'Neo Vitae' 'neovitae:ara_vitae' 'magic' 'Blood orbs, runes, rituals and alchemy.' -showlines
Q 'start' 'A New Kind of Vitae' 'check' '' 'xp:50' -icon 'minecraft:book' -desc 'Neo Vitae provides blood magic, a soul network, runes, rituals and alchemy. Use its in-game book and JEI for the exact recipes and multiblock layouts. This chapter is independent.'
Q 'book' 'The Neo Vitae Guide' 'neovitae:guide_book' 'start' 'xp:50' -desc 'Keep the installed Neo Vitae guide nearby; it explains this version of the mod.'
Q 'altar' 'Ara Vitae' 'neovitae:ara_vitae' 'book' 'xp:50' -desc 'Build the Ara Vitae and consult the guide for its blood supply and upgrade structure. Keep food and healing available.'
Q 'orb_weak' 'Weak Blood Orb' 'neovitae:blood_orb_weak' 'altar' 'xp:50' -desc 'Create the first Blood Orb and bind it as described in the guide. Orbs link progress to the soul network.'
Q 'orb_apprentice' 'Apprentice Blood Orb' 'neovitae:blood_orb_apprentice' 'orb_weak' 'xp:50' -desc 'Upgrade your altar setup and make the next orb. JEI shows its altar requirements.'
Q 'orb_magician' 'Magician Blood Orb' 'neovitae:blood_orb_magician' 'orb_apprentice' 'xp:50' -desc 'Continue altar progression and maintain a reliable blood supply.'
Q 'orb_master' 'Master Blood Orb' 'neovitae:blood_orb_master' 'orb_magician' 'xp:50' -desc 'Prepare the required altar tier and ingredients before starting this infusion.'
Q 'orb_archmage' 'Archmage Blood Orb' 'neovitae:blood_orb_archmage' 'orb_master' 'xp:50' -desc 'Reach the higher altar tier shown in JEI and the guide.'
Q 'runes' 'A Foundation of Runes' 'neovitae:rune_blank*8' 'altar' 'xp:50' -desc 'Runes form part of the altar upgrade structure. Follow the guide for their placement.'
Q 'speed' 'Speed Runes' 'neovitae:rune_speed' 'runes' 'xp:50' -desc 'Improve supported altar processing. Balance speed with your blood supply.'
Q 'capacity' 'Capacity Runes' 'neovitae:rune_capacity' 'runes' 'xp:50' -opt -desc 'Increase the altar buffer according to the guide.'
Q 'sacrifice' 'Self-Sacrifice Runes' 'neovitae:rune_sacrifice_self' 'runes' 'xp:50' -opt -desc 'Improve self-sacrifice efficiency. Keep enough health and food; do not automate unsafe damage.'
Q 'incense' 'Incense Altar' 'neovitae:incense_altar' 'runes' 'xp:50' -opt -desc 'Use the guide for incense placement and its self-sacrifice benefits.'
Q 'sigil' 'Divination Sigil' 'neovitae:sigil_divination' 'orb_weak' 'xp:50' -desc 'Inspect blood magic resources with a Divination Sigil.'
Q 'water' 'Water Sigil' 'neovitae:sigil_water' 'sigil' 'xp:50' -desc 'Check the guide for its soul-network cost and activation.'
Q 'air' 'Air Sigil' 'neovitae:sigil_air' 'sigil' 'xp:50' -opt -desc 'A mobility option that consumes blood magic resources.'
Q 'miner' 'Fast Miner Sigil' 'neovitae:sigil_fast_miner' 'sigil' 'xp:50' -opt -desc 'A utility sigil for mining; keep your network supplied.'
Q 'light' 'Blood Light Sigil' 'neovitae:sigil_blood_light' 'sigil' 'xp:50' -opt -desc 'Provide magical lighting. Check its cost before using it extensively.'
Q 'holding' 'Holding Sigil' 'neovitae:sigil_holding' 'sigil' 'xp:50' -opt -desc 'Organise compatible sigils as described in the guide.'
Q 'ritual' 'Ritual Foundations' 'neovitae:master_ritual_stone;neovitae:ritual_stone*8' 'orb_magician' 'xp:50' -desc 'Rituals need the right structure, activation and a supplied soul network. Read the guide before activation.'
Q 'diviner' 'Ritual Diviner' 'neovitae:ritual_diviner' 'ritual' 'xp:50' -desc 'Use the Diviner to help assemble supported ritual structures.'
Q 'activation' 'Activate a Ritual' 'neovitae:activation_crystal_weak' 'diviner' 'xp:50' -desc 'Create an activation crystal. This item quest does not prove a ritual is running.'
Q 'awakened' 'Awakened Activation' 'neovitae:activation_crystal_awakened' 'activation,orb_master' 'xp:50' -opt -desc 'Prepare the stronger activation crystal for supported rituals.'
Q 'athanor' 'The Athanor' 'neovitae:athanor' 'orb_apprentice' 'xp:50' -desc 'Use the Athanor for the alchemy recipes listed in JEI.'
Q 'flask' 'Alchemy Flask' 'neovitae:alchemy_flask' 'athanor' 'xp:50' -desc 'Prepare a flask and consult the guide for brewing and use.'
Q 'tank' 'Blood Storage' 'neovitae:blood_tank' 'athanor' 'xp:50' -desc 'Provide storage for your blood magic infrastructure.'
Q 'crafter' 'Sanguine Crafting' 'neovitae:sanguine_crafter' 'tank,orb_master' 'xp:50' -desc 'Automate supported crafting while keeping ingredient supply and storage organised.'
Q 'mastery' 'A Living Network' 'check' 'crafter,orb_archmage,activation' 'xp:250;table:arcane' -desc 'Complete the main altar, ritual and alchemy branches. Optional utility sigils do not block chapter mastery.'
